# Application configuration

- Main defaults live in `src/main/resources/application.properties` (committed). Override secrets and environment-specific values via **environment variables** (e.g. `JWT_SECRET`, `DATABASE_URL`, `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`) — do not commit production secrets.
- Files matching `src/main/resources/application-*.properties` are **gitignored** by design; use them locally or in deployment, not as the only place critical defaults exist unless documented.
- Test configuration lives under `src/test/resources` (e.g. `application-test.properties` if present); integration tests use `@ActiveProfiles("test")` where applicable.
- Flyway flags (`spring.flyway.*`) and JWT/CORS settings must remain consistent with `WebSecurityConfig` and deployment docs when you change them.
